# (3) NpT run of cubic ScF3 at 300 K (../39_xdatcar2adp, 4x4x4).
# XDATCAR_every10 holds every 10th frame of configurations 2000-5000 of the
# 4001-frame run (the first 1000 frames discarded; 301 frames). Every irrep is
# single-peaked about Q = 0: displacive fluctuations of a cubic crystal. The
# octahedral tilts R4+ and M3+ carry the largest amplitudes but have few
# independent samples (n_eff 16-29, autocorrelation times of 10-19 frames
# here, 100-190 configurations of the run), so the ratio of a single
# component scatters (0.71-0.86 for R4+); pooled over the three equivalent R4+
# components it is 0.768, and M3+ gives 0.773 (Gaussian 0.798). The stiff
# modes reach n_eff 301, the number of frames: 10 configurations apart,
# successive frames are nearly uncorrelated for them.
# The full 41.7 MB XDATCAR (not in the pip package) with --start-step 1000 gives the
# same shapes, Q within 0.0002 A and ratios within 0.015 (M3+ 0.772).

$ crystod-md --project -c ../test_POSCARs/221_PPOSCAR_ScF3 --dim 4 4 4 --xdatcar ../39_xdatcar2adp/ScF3_Pm-3m_NpT_300K/XDATCAR_every10 --start-step 0 --qpoint R M -o MDPROJ_ScF3_300K

