# (5) Phonon-eigenvector basis (--yaml phonopy_params.yaml, the 4x4x4 force
# constants of ../33_modulation/ScF3_Pm-3m): the basis at every q is the
# set of symmetry-adapted eigenvectors of crystod-phonon --modulation/--vector
# (same mode numbers, 1-based), the trajectory is taken in mass-weighted
# coordinates w = sqrt(m) u, and every column is the normal coordinate
# a = p_hat . w of the supercell (A sqrt(amu)); A = a/sqrt(N) per parent cell.
# The parent cell is the primitive cell of the yaml (-c is not needed; if
# given, it must be that cell). The R4+ structure of (2) carries
# A = 0.3 |sqrt(m) v| = 0.3 sqrt(m_F) = 1.307615 on one R4+ mode (here mode 3:
# crystod-phonon --modulation --mode 3 --amplitude 0.3 reproduces
# POSCAR_I4mcm_3 byte for byte) and nothing on any other mode.

$ crystod-md --project --yaml ../33_modulation/ScF3_Pm-3m/phonopy_params.yaml --dim 2 2 2 --xdatcar XDATCAR_I4mcm_1 --qpoint R -o MDPROJ_I4mcm_1_phonon --no-histogram

* Input *
  Parent cell     : primitive cell of ../33_modulation/ScF3_Pm-3m/phonopy_params.yaml
  Space group     : Pm-3m (No. 221)
  Supercell (dim) : 2 2 2 (8 parent cells, 32 atoms)
  Trajectory      : XDATCAR_I4mcm_1 (1 frame)
  Frames used     : 1 (step 0 .. 0; configuration 1 .. 1)
  Lattice         : fixed cell
  Force constants : ../33_modulation/ScF3_Pm-3m/phonopy_params.yaml (no NAC)
  Basis           : phonon eigenvectors at each q (mass-weighted)

* Site matching *
  Sites matched   : 32 (one-to-one, by element and nearest image
                    of the time-averaged position)
  Uniform shift   : (+0.0000, +0.0000, +0.0000) A (mean offset of the averaged structure)
  Largest offset  : 0.2121 A (atom 9, uniform shift removed)
  Drift           : the mass-weighted centre-of-mass displacement is removed
                    from every frame (rms 0.0000 A)

* Q points *
  R        (1/2, 1/2, 1/2)

* Mode projection at R (1/2, 1/2, 1/2), phonon-eigenvector basis *
mode  irrep   nu_harm (THz)  <a> (A sqrt(amu))  sqrt<a^2> (A sqrt(amu))  sqrt<A^2> per cell  ratio  kurtosis  n_eff  shape
1     R4+(3)  1.4169         0.00000            0.00000                  0.00000             -      -         -      zero
2     R4+(3)  1.4169         0.00000            0.00000                  0.00000             -      -         -      zero
